    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Alex et Jeff, coll\u00e8gues de bureau dans une multinationale, sont aussi les meilleurs amis du monde depuis le lyc\u00e9e. Avec leurs femmes respectives, ils forment ensemble presque une famille, qui se fraye un chemin dans la vie, tranquillement, doucement, sans grande ambition. Pourtant l\u2019arriv\u00e9e de Thibaut, conf\u00e9rencier et sp\u00e9cialiste en d\u00e9veloppement personnel, ne va pas tarder \u00e0 mettre \u00e0 mal leur \u00e9quilibre p\u00e9p\u00e8re. Et pour cause, Thibaut est un ami d\u2019enfance d\u2019Alex. \u00c0 l\u2019\u00e9poque, ces deux-l\u00e0, super complex\u00e9s et toujours mis \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9cart dans la cour d\u2019\u00e9cole, s\u2019\u00e9taient promis de r\u00e9ussir leur vie, co\u00fbte que co\u00fbte. Aujourd\u2019hui, le beau et brillant Thibaut semble pour sa part avoir tenu sa promesse et pousse Alex \u00e0 r\u00e9aliser ses r\u00eaves au risque de perdre l\u2019amiti\u00e9 de Jeff... Mais sommes-nous tous vou\u00e9s \u00e0 un destin exceptionnel ?",
        "english": "Alex and Jeff, colleagues in the office of a multinational firm, have also been best friends since high school. With their respective wives, they almost form a family, making their way through life, peacefully, gently, and without any great ambition. However, the arrival of Thibaut, a speaker and personnel development specialist, will soon play havoc with their quiet little lives. Thibaut is in fact a childhood friend of Alex. Back when they were kids, they were both highly uptight and always shunned in the school yard, and they vowed that they'd get ahead in life, no matter the cost. Now, handsome and brilliant Thibaut seems to have kept his promise and encourages Alex to fulfill his dreams at the risk of losing Jeff's friendship... But are we all destined for an exceptional destiny?"
    },
